{
 "total": 38.539,
 "frases": [
  {
   "i": 0,
   "a": 0.15,
   "b": 2.193,
   "texto": "Your brand new fence post is already leaning!",
   "h": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 1,
   "a": 2.313,
   "b": 4.898,
   "texto": "Hit like and follow. Flo set this one in ten minutes!",
   "h": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 2,
   "a": 5.018,
   "b": 7.951,
   "texto": "I dug a hole one foot deep. That's plenty for a post!",
   "h": 1
  },
  {
   "i": 3,
   "a": 8.071,
   "b": 11.697,
   "texto": "Too shallow. The wind pushes the fence like a sail, and the post tips.",
   "h": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 4,
   "a": 11.817,
   "b": 16.31,
   "texto": "And where it freezes, the frozen ground swells. It lifts the post a little more every winter.",
   "h": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 5,
   "a": 16.43,
   "b": 17.851,
   "texto": "So how deep is deep enough?",
   "h": 1
  },
  {
   "i": 6,
   "a": 17.971,
   "b": 20.275,
   "texto": "A common rule: bury about one third of the post.",
   "h": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 7,
   "a": 20.395,
   "b": 22.966,
   "texto": "An eight foot post? Almost three feet in the ground.",
   "h": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 8,
   "a": 23.086,
   "b": 25.699,
   "texto": "And in cold climates, go below your local frost line.",
   "h": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 9,
   "a": 25.819,
   "b": 27.196,
   "texto": "And what do I pack around it?",
   "h": 1
  },
  {
   "i": 10,
   "a": 27.316,
   "b": 30.635,
   "texto": "Gravel or soil, a few inches at a time. Tamp every layer hard.",
   "h": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 11,
   "a": 30.755,
   "b": 32.995,
   "texto": "Fine. A deeper hole. My arms hate you.",
   "h": 1
  },
  {
   "i": 12,
   "a": 33.115,
   "b": 36.399,
   "texto": "One foot deep, or one third of the post? Team Norm or Team Flo?",
   "h": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 13,
   "a": 36.519,
   "b": 38.539,
   "texto": "Follow for more backyard builds that won't fail!",
   "h": 0
  }
 ],
